{
  "id": "ss.enemy.sprayer",
  "name": "Sprayer",
  "description": "The burrow's ranged caste: it turns its own gaster over its back and points the acidopore down the passage. That posture is the entire silhouette and the entire tell — a sac carried high with a spout aimed forward, so a body holding still at the far end of a corridor still reads as loaded. Teal for the same reason the Gland is: the bolt it fires is `ss.enemy.shot`, and a shooter should be the colour of what it throws. No `elite` variant on purpose — the marking only ever lands on a body the wave table is spawning, and this one arrives in squads. Drawn facing +x, the game flips it. Gameplay radius 10.",
